msgctxt "92"
msgid ""
"The kids at Morning Glory Orphanage sure are great. Kiryu-san must set "
"quite an example for them, don't you think?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid ""
"I always see them playing so nicely together on the beach. They certainly "
"are an energetic bunch."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid ""
"After the previous director passed, I was worried that the kids wouldn't "
"have anyone to look after them..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid ""
"Thank goodness Kiryu-san came in from Tokyo. He may look a little "
"intimidating, but the kids love him, and he seems like a really nice guy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid ""
"And the girl he brought with him⑬Haruka-chan, was it? She's so responsible, "
"cooking and cleaning like that. Kids from the mainland sure are dependable."
msgstr ""

